/*
 * ControlExpander — expands all control-flow constructs into YIL instructions.
 *
 * The ControlExpander lowers high-level semantic control-flow nodes into
 * concrete YIL constructs. It handles:
 *
 *   - blocks and inline blocks,
 *   - conditional expressions,
 *   - loops(compile-time and classic),
 *   - try/catch and try/finally constructs,
 *   - list comprehensions,
 *   - scope-based value propagation.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::lint::expander::value::control
 * @File: ymirc/lint/expander/value/control.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-22
